
GENERAL INFORMATION
===================

The MEGACO (Media Gateway Control Protocol) PDU decoder.
Invoking `make` will compile the ASN.1 specifications from the rfc3525.txt
in the above directory.

megaco-dump USAGE
=================

The -iber option is required, because the default input format is PER:

	./megaco-dump -iber MegacoMessage.ber	# Print as XML (BASIC-XER)

The full list of recognized command line options may be obtained with

	> ./megaco-dump -h

